    excerpt: 'Dubai property buyers judge a listing website in seconds. Here is what real estate website design in the UAE needs to get right to turn browsers into qualified leads.',
    metaTitle: 'Real Estate Website Design UAE: What Converts Leads | Zenexio',
    metaDescription: 'A practical guide to real estate website design in the UAE — property search, listing pages, lead capture, and the mistakes that quietly kill conversion.',
